Source   <== SKIP TopLevel*
TopLevel <-- FuncDef / EventDef
FuncDef  <== Decorator* `def` @Name `(` Params? @`)` (`->` Name)? `:`
             Body
Decorator <-- `@` Name (`(` (!LINEBREAK .)* `)`)? LINEBREAK?
EventDef <== `event` @Name `:` Body

Body     <-- Statement+
Statement <-- SKIP (Return / IfStmt / Assign / ExprStmt)
Return   <== `return` @Expr LINEBREAK?
IfStmt   <== `if` @Cond `:` Body (`else` `:` Body)~?
Assign   <== Name @`:` Type @`=` Expr LINEBREAK?
ExprStmt <-- Call LINEBREAK?
Expr     <-- Call / Cond / Name / Number
Call     <== Name `(` (Expr (`,` @Expr)*)? @`)`
Cond     <-- {!LINEBREAK !`:` .}+
Params   <-- Param (`,` @Param)*
Param    <-- Name @`:` Type
Type     <-- {[_%a][_%w]*} SKIP
Name     <-- {[_%a][_%w]*} SKIP
Number   <-- {[+-]? %d+ ('.' %d+)?} -> tonumber SKIP

Keyword  <-- `def` / `return` / `if` / `else` / `event` / `log`
NAME_SUFFIX <-- [_%w]+
SKIP     <-- (%s / LINEBREAK)*
LINEBREAK <-- %cn %cr? / %cr
